<section class="shrink-0 border-y border-line bg-oat py-4 sm:py-5 lg:py-5" aria-label="Facts about us"><dl class="wrap grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 lg:gap-6"><div><dt class="text-xs text-ink-700 sm:text-sm">Our ghee</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 sm:mt-1 sm:text-lg">Pure desi ghee</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-ink-700 sm:text-sm">Made from</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 sm:mt-1 sm:text-lg">Buffalo milk</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-ink-700 sm:text-sm">Preservatives</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 sm:mt-1 sm:text-lg">None</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-ink-700 sm:text-sm">Additives</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 sm:mt-1 sm:text-lg">None</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-ink-700 sm:text-sm">Packs</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 sm:mt-1 sm:text-lg">500 ml, 1 L, 5 L</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-ink-700 sm:text-sm">Based in</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 sm:mt-1 sm:text-lg">Rohtak, Haryana</dd></div></dl></section>
<section class="wrap grid gap-8 py-10 sm:py-14 lg:py-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] xl:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-10 xl:gap-14 items-center"><div class="prose-ghee"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Why we started</h2><p>Many of us grew up with a matka of homemade ghee in the kitchen: white, thick buffalo ghee, made slowly at home from full-fat milk. It went on hot rotis, into dal, and into every halwa and ladoo.</p><p>That ghee was pure, simple and rich, and it is getting harder to find. Farm Dip exists to bring it back: ghee made the way we ate it in our childhood, from pure buffalo milk, with nothing added.</p><h2>What goes into our ghee</h2><p>Pure buffalo milk. That is the whole list. It is turned into ghee the bilona way, slowly: set into dahi, churned, washed and clarified, so it keeps its authentic taste and rich aroma.</p><h2>What we will never add</h2><ul><li>Preservatives</li><li>Additives or flavours</li><li>Colour</li><li>Vanaspati, vegetable oil or any other fat</li></ul></div><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 sm:gap-5 lg:gap-6"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-line/70 bg-oat shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg h-[380px] xs:h-[420px] sm:h-[500px] lg:h-[620px] xl:h-[660px] w-full " role="region" data-slideshow data-interval="4000" data-delay="0" aria-label="Farm photography slideshow"><div data-track class="flex h-full w-full transition-transform duration-700 ease-out will-change-transform"><div class="relative size-full min-w-full shrink-0"><img width="900" height="1200" alt="Young buffalo calf at the farm" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="{{ 'farm-c1.jpeg' | asset_url }}"></div><div class="relative size-full min-w-full shrink-0"><img width="900" height="1200" alt="Calves resting in the open farm shelter" loading="lazy" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="{{ 'farm-c2.jpeg' | asset_url }}"></div><div class="relative size-full min-w-full shrink-0"><img width="900" height="1200" alt="Healthy buffalo at Farm Dip" loading="lazy" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="{{ 'farm-c3.jpeg' | asset_url }}"></div><div class="relative size-full min-w-full shrink-0"><img width="900" height="1200" alt="Farm Dip buffaloes grazing peacefully" loading="lazy" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="{{ 'farm-c4.jpeg' | asset_url }}"></div><div class="relative size-full min-w-full shrink-0"><img width="900" height="1200" alt="Buffaloes at the farm" loading="lazy" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="{{ 'farm-c5.jpeg' | asset_url }}"></div><div class="relative size-full min-w-full shrink-0"><img width="900" height="1200" alt="Farm Dip cattle outdoors" loading="lazy" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="{{ 'farm-c6.jpeg' | asset_url }}"></div></div><button type="button" class="absolute left-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-cream/80 text-ink-900 opacity-0 shadow-md backdrop-blur-xs transition-opacity duration-200 hover:bg-cream group-hover:opacity-100" aria-label="Previous photo" data-prev><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4 rotate-90" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="absolute right-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-cream/80 text-ink-900 opacity-0 shadow-md backdrop-blur-xs transition-opacity dura